{"type":"text","timestamp":1790897504552,"sessionID":"ses_f063169adffeNfp7kXE6i2KY0T","part":{"id":"prt_0f9cf332a001hRmBnJ5eqnSYr0","messageID":"msg_0f9cf2c75001pdAxJMMTCTsalg","sessionID":"ses_f063169adffeNfp7kXE6i2KY0T","type":"text","text":"The answer has been submitted. Summary of findings from `src/cachetools/__init__.py`:\n\n- **visible_at_deadline (false):** `__contains__` uses a strict comparison `self.timer() < link.expires`, so at the exact expiration instant the entry is no longer a member.\n- **expired_read_removes_storage (false):** an expired `__getitem__` delegates to `Cache.__missing__`, which only raises `KeyError` — the stored value is not physically deleted.\n- **assignment_refreshes_deadline (true):** `__setitem__` reuses/unlinks the existing link and unconditionally sets `link.expires = time + self.__ttl`.\n- **expire_reports_removed_pairs (true):** `expire()` builds and returns a list of `(key, value)` pairs for each item it removes.","time":{"start":1790897500970,"end":1790897504546}}}
